{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於剛結束糟糕會議、深夜趕論文或心情煩躁的用戶而言，這款 App 提供了一個極具創意的宣洩出口。它允許你透過聲音與動作破壞螢幕上的文字貼紙，將負面情緒具象化並徹底粉碎，讓你感受心理上的輕鬆。目前正值限時免費優惠期，原價 US $0.99，建議立即下載體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>聲控破壞減壓</h2>\n<p>打開 App 後，螢幕會堆滿代表壓力來源的文字貼紙。用戶只需對著手機大喊、拍手或吹口哨，音量越大破壞效果越強烈，伴隨彩帶飛散與手機震動反饋。內建工作、學生等多種字庫，亦支援自訂詞彙如老闆姓名，讓你在無記錄、完全離線的環境中，安全且有趣地釋放積鬱。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AHHH!-Scream Stress Relief</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T00:46:22.679168+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}